      # Example values

      [HTML reference](VALUES.html)

      ```yaml
      target:  # string, required
      renderMode:  # string
      services:  # map
        <ID>:  # map, by type
          # type: greeter
          # type:  # string, required
          # greeting:  # string, per target
          # ports:  # list of int, per target
          #   - # int
          # type: environment
          # type:  # string, required
          # environment:  # map
          #   <key>:  # scalar, per target
      <key>:  # any
      ```

      ## (root)

      | Key | Type | Per target | Default | Required | Description |
      | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
      | `target` | string | no |  | yes | Render target. |
      | `renderMode` | string, one of: validate, deploy | no | `"deploy"` |  | Mode \| see README. |
      | `services` | map, keys match `^[A-Z]+$` |  |  |  | Services by ID. |
      | `<key>` | any |  |  |  | The consumer chart's own keys. |

      ## `services`

      Services by ID.

      | Key | Type |
      | --- | --- |
      | `<ID>` | map, by `type`: greeter, environment |

      ## `services.*[type=greeter]`

      Writes a greeting.

      | Key | Type | Per target | Required | Description |
      | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
      | `type` (shared) | string | no | yes |  |
      | `greeting` | string | yes |  | File content. |
      | `ports` | list of int | yes |  |  |

      **Example** (generated)

      ```yaml
      services:
        <ID>:
          greeting:
            default: text
            prod: text
          ports:
            default:
            - 1
            prod:
            - 1
          type: greeter
      ```

      ## `services.*[type=environment]`

      | Key | Type | Per target | Required |
      | --- | --- | --- | --- |
      | `type` (shared) | string | no | yes |
      | `environment` | map, keys match `^[A-Z]+$` |  |  |

      **Example** (generated)

      ```yaml
      services:
        <ID>:
          environment: {}
          type: environment
      ```

      ## `services.*[type=environment].environment`

      | Key | Type | Per target |
      | --- | --- | --- |
      | `<key>` | scalar | yes |
